{"id": "2af3cf1f-965e-41a4-81c2-44864fb9aee0", "slug": "aether-shader-depth-component", "title": "AETHER · Shader Depth Component", "description": "Aether Shader Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"AETHER · Shader Depth Component\"\ndescription: \"Aether Shader Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#030303\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AETHER · Shader Depth Component\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 11; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nAether Shader Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nA E T H E R Component · 04 WebGL Altitude 2,418 m Depth Matrix Parallax occlusion mapping rendering a monolithic landscape in real-time. 48.41°N · 12.07°E 60 FPS Target POM Parallax Interactive Tilt Procedural Generatio…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Depth Matrix.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #030303, accent #10B981, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>AETHER · Shader Depth Component</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white/90 h-[100svh] w-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative selection:bg-white/20\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background WebGL -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Grain/Vignette Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none mix-blend-overlay opacity-40\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[2] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 20%, rgba(3,3,3,0.85) 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Layout -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-5xl px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-y-6 md:gap-y-10 h-full max-h-[900px]\">\n\n        <!-- Header / Eyebrow -->\n        <header class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"gsap-reveal text-sm tracking-[0.4em] uppercase font-semibold text-white/50\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    A E T H E R\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 opacity-0 gsap-fade\">\n                <div class=\"gsap-spark w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10b981] shadow-[0_0_10px_#10b981]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-white/60\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    Component · <span class=\"text-white font-medium\">04</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- 3D Perspective Stage -->\n        <div class=\"perspective-[1200px] w-full flex justify-center opacity-0 gsap-scale\">\n            <!-- Card Wrapper with Gradient Border -->\n            <div id=\"card-wrapper\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[340px] md:max-w-[400px] aspect-[4/5.5] rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] will-change-transform transform-style-3d\">\n\n                <!-- Inner Card -->\n                <article class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#080808] rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] overflow-hidden transform-style-3d\">\n                    <!-- Terrain WebGL -->\n                    <canvas id=\"terrain-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n                    <!-- UI Overlay -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 p-5 md:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none\">\n\n                        <!-- Top Row -->\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full\">\n                            <!-- Pill -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                                <div class=\"gsap-spark w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10b981] shadow-[0_0_8px_#10b981]\"></div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-white/80\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">WebGL</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- HUD -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end text-right\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase text-white/40 mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Altitude</span>\n                                <div class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white/90 leading-none mb-3\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                                    <span id=\"alt-readout\">2,418</span><span class=\"text-xs text-white/40 ml-1 font-normal\">m</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Signal Bars -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-[3px] h-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"gsap-bar w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-white/80 rounded-full h-[30%] origin-bottom\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"gsap-bar w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-white/80 rounded-full h-[60%] origin-bottom\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"gsap-bar w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-white/80 rounded-full h-[100%] origin-bottom\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"gsap-bar w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-white/80 rounded-full h-[80%] origin-bottom\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"gsap-bar w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-white/80 rounded-full h-[40%] origin-bottom\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Corner Accents (Inline SVG for precision) -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-5 left-5 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/20 rounded-tl-lg gsap-corner\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-5 right-5 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/20 rounded-tr-lg gsap-corner\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/20 rounded-bl-lg gsap-corner\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/20 rounded-br-lg gsap-corner\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Bottom Row -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 relative z-20\">\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                                <h1 class=\"gsap-reveal text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-none\">Depth Matrix</h1>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                                <p class=\"gsap-reveal text-xs md:text-sm text-white/50 max-w-[240px] leading-relaxed\">\n                                    Parallax occlusion mapping rendering a monolithic landscape in real-time.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-2\">\n                                <span id=\"coord-readout\" class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">48.41°N · 12.07°E</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-[#10b981] text-sm gsap-arrow\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Interactive Chips -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:gap-4 opacity-0 gsap-fade\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm cursor-default transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" class=\"text-[#10b981] text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-white/80\">60 FPS Target</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm cursor-default transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-white/80\">POM Parallax</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm cursor-default transition-colors hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-white/80\">Interactive Tilt</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"mt-auto pb-4 opacity-0 gsap-fade\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-white/30\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                Procedural Generation · Zero Dependencies\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\n            // --- GSAP Animations ---\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Masked Reveal for Text\n            tl.fromTo(\".gsap-reveal\",\n                { y: \"110%\", opacity: 0 },\n                { y: \"0%\", opacity: 1, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"expo.out\" },\n                0.2\n            );\n\n            // Scale in Card\n            tl.fromTo(\".gsap-scale\",\n                { scale: 0.9, opacity: 0, rotationX: 10 },\n                { scale: 1, opacity: 1, rotationX: 0, duration: 1.2 },\n                0.4\n            );\n\n            // Fade in other elements\n            tl.fromTo(\".gsap-fade\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 10 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1 },\n                0.6\n            );\n\n            // Ambient looped animations\n            gsap.to(\".gsap-spark\", { scale: 1.4, opacity: 0.5, duration: 1.5, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n            gsap.to(\".gsap-arrow\", { x: 4, duration: 1.2, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: \"power1.inOut\" });\n            gsap.to(\".gsap-corner\", { opacity: 0.3, duration: 2, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: \"sine.inOut\", stagger: 0.2 });\n\n            // Audio visualizer style bars\n            document.querySelectorAll(\".gsap-bar\").forEach((bar, i) => {\n                gsap.to(bar, {\n                    scaleY: 0.4 + Math.random() * 0.6,\n                    duration: 0.4 + Math.random() * 0.4,\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    delay: i * 0.1\n                });\n            });\n\n            // --- WebGL Setup ---\n            const VERT_SRC = `attribute vec2 aPos; void main(){ gl_Position=vec4(aPos,0.0,1.0); }`;\n            const NOISE_GLSL = `\n                float hash(vec2 p){ p=fract(p*vec2(123.34,345.45)); p+=dot(p,p+34.345); return fract(p.x*p.y); }\n                float noise(vec2 p){ vec2 i=floor(p),f=fract(p); vec2 u=f*f*(3.0-2.0*f);\n                float a=hash(i),b=hash(i+vec2(1.0,0.0)),c=hash(i+vec2(0.0,1.0)),d=hash(i+vec2(1.0,1.0));\n                return mix(mix(a,b,u.x),mix(c,d,u.x),u.y); }\n            `;\n\n            // Background Shader: Monochromatic dark grain and subtle movement\n            const BG_FRAG = `\n                precision highp float;\n                uniform vec2 uRes; uniform float uTime; uniform vec2 uTilt;\n                ${NOISE_GLSL}\n                float fbm(vec2 p){ float v=0.0,a=0.5; for(int i=0;i<3;i++){ v+=a*noise(p); p*=2.0; a*=0.5; } return v; }\n                void main(){\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy/uRes.xy;\n                    vec2 p = uv; p.x *= uRes.x/uRes.y;\n                    vec2 q = p * 2.0 + vec2(uTime*0.02, -uTime*0.01) + uTilt*0.05;\n                    float f = fbm(q + fbm(q*1.2 + uTime*0.05));\n\n                    vec3 c_base = vec3(0.01, 0.01, 0.012);\n                    vec3 c_light = vec3(0.06, 0.06, 0.065);\n                    vec3 col = mix(c_base, c_light, smoothstep(0.2, 0.8, f));\n\n                    col += (hash(gl_FragCoord.xy + uTime) - 0.5) * 0.03; // Dithering/Grain\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            // Terrain Shader: Monochromatic POM with Emerald accents\n            const TERRAIN_FRAG = `\n                precision highp float;\n                uniform vec2 uRes; uniform float uTime; uniform vec2 uTilt;\n                ${NOISE_GLSL}\n                float fbm4(vec2 p){ float v=0.0,a=0.5; mat2 m=mat2(1.6,1.2,-1.2,1.6);\n                    for(int i=0;i<4;i++){ v+=a*noise(p); p=m*p; a*=0.5; } return v; }\n                float terrain(vec2 p){\n                    vec2 q = p*2.5 + vec2(uTime*0.03, -uTime*0.02);\n                    float h = fbm4(q);\n                    float r = 1.0 - abs(fbm4(q*1.5 + 4.0)*2.0-1.0);\n                    return clamp(mix(h, r, 0.4), 0.0, 1.0);\n                }\n                void main(){\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy/uRes.xy;\n                    vec2 asp = vec2(uRes.x/uRes.y, 1.0);\n\n                    const int STEPS = 8;\n                    float nl = float(STEPS);\n                    vec2 dUV = (uTilt * 0.15) / nl;\n                    float layer = 1.0/nl;\n                    float curL = 0.0;\n                    vec2 cuv = uv;\n                    float d = 1.0 - terrain(cuv*asp);\n\n                    for(int i=0; i<STEPS; i++){\n                        if(curL >= d) break;\n                        cuv += dUV;\n                        d = 1.0 - terrain(cuv*asp);\n                        curL += layer;\n                    }\n\n                    vec2 prev = cuv - dUV;\n                    float w = (d - curL) / ((d - curL) - ((1.0-terrain(prev*asp)) - (curL-layer)) + 0.0001);\n                    cuv = mix(cuv, prev, clamp(w, 0.0, 1.0));\n\n                    float h = terrain(cuv*asp);\n                    float e = 0.003;\n                    float hl = terrain((cuv-vec2(e,0.0))*asp), hr = terrain((cuv+vec2(e,0.0))*asp);\n                    float hd = terrain((cuv-vec2(0.0,e))*asp), hu = terrain((cuv+vec2(0.0,e))*asp);\n                    vec3 n = normalize(vec3((hl-hr),(hd-hu), e*4.0));\n\n                    vec3 L = normalize(vec3(cos(uTime*0.2)*0.8, 0.6, sin(uTime*0.2)*0.8));\n                    float diff = clamp(dot(n,L), 0.0, 1.0);\n\n                    // Monochromatic palette\n                    vec3 c1 = vec3(0.03);\n                    vec3 c2 = vec3(0.10);\n                    vec3 c3 = vec3(0.25);\n                    vec3 c4 = vec3(0.40);\n\n                    vec3 col = mix(c1, c2, smoothstep(0.1, 0.4, h));\n                    col = mix(col, c3, smoothstep(0.4, 0.7, h));\n                    col = mix(col, c4, smoothstep(0.7, 0.95, h));\n\n                    col *= 0.2 + diff*0.9;\n\n                    // Emerald contour lines\n                    float grid = fract(h*18.0 - uTime*0.08);\n                    float line = smoothstep(0.06, 0.0, min(grid, 1.0-grid));\n                    col += line * vec3(0.06, 0.72, 0.50) * 0.4 * smoothstep(0.2, 1.0, h);\n\n                    // Fog/Depth fade\n                    float fog = smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, curL);\n                    col = mix(col, vec3(0.03), fog*0.6);\n\n                    // Vignette inside card\n                    float vig = smoothstep(1.0, 0.3, length((uv-0.5)*vec2(1.0, 1.2)));\n                    col *= mix(0.4, 1.0, vig);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            function initWebGL(canvasId, fragSrc) {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n                const gl = canvas.getContext(\"webgl\", { antialias: false, powerPreference: \"high-performance\" });\n                if (!gl) return null;\n\n                const vs = gl.createShader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER);\n                gl.shaderSource(vs, VERT_SRC);\n                gl.compileShader(vs);\n\n                const fs = gl.createShader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER);\n                gl.shaderSource(fs, fragSrc);\n                gl.compileShader(fs);\n\n                const prog = gl.createProgram();\n                gl.attachShader(prog, vs);\n                gl.attachShader(prog, fs);\n                gl.linkProgram(prog);\n                gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n                const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n                gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n                gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1, 3,-1, -1,3]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n                const aPos = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, \"aPos\");\n                gl.enableVertexAttribArray(aPos);\n                gl.vertexAttribPointer(aPos, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n                return {\n                    gl, prog, canvas, buf,\n                    uRes: gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"uRes\"),\n                    uTime: gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"uTime\"),\n                    uTilt: gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"uTilt\")\n                };\n            }\n\n            const bgCtx = initWebGL(\"bg-canvas\", BG_FRAG);\n            const terrainCtx = initWebGL(\"terrain-canvas\", TERRAIN_FRAG);\n\n            function resizeContext(ctx, scaleMultiplier = 1) {\n                if(!ctx) return;\n                const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n                const rect = ctx.canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const w = Math.floor((rect.width || window.innerWidth) * dpr * scaleMultiplier);\n                const h = Math.floor((rect.height || window.innerHeight) * dpr * scaleMultiplier);\n                if(ctx.canvas.width !== w || ctx.canvas.height !== h){\n                    ctx.canvas.width = w;\n                    ctx.canvas.height = h;\n                    ctx.gl.viewport(0, 0, w, h);\n                }\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                resizeContext(bgCtx, 0.5); // Render bg lower res for performance/blur\n                resizeContext(terrainCtx, 0.7);\n            });\n\n            // Initial resize\n            resizeContext(bgCtx, 0.5);\n            resizeContext(terrainCtx, 0.7);\n\n            // --- Interaction & Render Loop ---\n            let targetTilt = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n            let currentTilt = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n            const cardWrapper = document.getElementById(\"card-wrapper\");\n            const altReadout = document.getElementById(\"alt-readout\");\n            const coordReadout = document.getElementById(\"coord-readout\");\n\n            window.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", (e) => {\n                targetTilt.x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n                targetTilt.y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 2 - 1;\n            });\n\n            const startT = performance.now();\n            let lastUpdate = 0;\n\n            function render() {\n                const time = (performance.now() - startT) / 1000;\n\n                // Smooth tilt interpolation\n                currentTilt.x += (targetTilt.x - currentTilt.x) * 0.08;\n                currentTilt.y += (targetTilt.y - currentTilt.y) * 0.08;\n\n                // Apply 3D transform to card wrapper (subtle)\n                const rotX = -currentTilt.y * 6;\n                const rotY = currentTilt.x * 6;\n                cardWrapper.style.transform = `rotateX(${rotX.toFixed(2)}deg) rotateY(${rotY.toFixed(2)}deg)`;\n\n                // Draw BG\n                if(bgCtx) {\n                    bgCtx.gl.uniform2f(bgCtx.uRes, bgCtx.canvas.width, bgCtx.canvas.height);\n                    bgCtx.gl.uniform1f(bgCtx.uTime, time);\n                    bgCtx.gl.uniform2f(bgCtx.uTilt, currentTilt.x * 0.5, -currentTilt.y * 0.5);\n                    bgCtx.gl.drawArrays(bgCtx.gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n                }\n\n                // Draw Terrain\n                if(terrainCtx) {\n                    terrainCtx.gl.uniform2f(terrainCtx.uRes, terrainCtx.canvas.width, terrainCtx.canvas.height);\n                    terrainCtx.gl.uniform1f(terrainCtx.uTime, time);\n                    terrainCtx.gl.uniform2f(terrainCtx.uTilt, currentTilt.x, -currentTilt.y);\n                    terrainCtx.gl.drawArrays(terrainCtx.gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n                }\n\n                // Update HUD texts periodically to avoid layout thrashing\n                if(performance.now() - lastUpdate > 100) {\n                    const alt = Math.floor(2418 + Math.sin(time * 0.5) * 150);\n                    altReadout.innerText = alt.toLocaleString();\n                    const lat = (48.41 + Math.sin(time * 0.2) * 0.05).toFixed(2);\n                    const lon = (12.07 + Math.cos(time * 0.15) * 0.05).toFixed(2);\n                    coordReadout.innerText = `${lat}°N · ${lon}°E`;\n                    lastUpdate = performance.now();\n                }\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            }\n\n            // Start loop\n            requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-shader-depth-component.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aether-shader-depth-component.jpg", "source_name": "aether-shader-depth-component-DESIGN.md", "views": 18, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T17:56:09.440085+00:00"}